0     ih       legacy positive log objective; 1=unweighted least squares
0     iw       0=unweighted; 1=Gaussian errors; 2=full covariance precision file
0.0  0.0       pb0,pb1 periodic open exclusion interval; equal bounds exclude nothing
7     ns       floating-default kernel exp(-r^2/ns^2), in map pixels
8e-4  ac       optimizer stationarity tolerance
1000  nim      maximum iterations per regularization value
0.002 1.7 0    al0,alf,nal starting alpha, divisor, attempts (0=one)
1.6   clim     RMS target, not reduced chi-square
2     ipri     log verbosity
0     norm     preserve phase-dependent flux; 1=conditional flat-flux normalization
10e5  0        wid,af empirical absorption scale cm/s and amplitude (0=disabled)
0.0 0 0.1      instrumental sigma cm/s, minimum exposure samples, baseline fraction
